# Review-round scratch: spec drafts and model transcripts, not project source.
# Five of these were committed once (4345910) along with a 10 MB unstripped
# fencetest binary -- in a repository whose test runner hashes /proc/<pid>/exe
# specifically because a stale binary once produced three green suites.
/t[0-9]*.txt

# local agent memory store (not project code)
/.github/copilot-memories.*

